{
  "id": "ACT.23",
  "number": "23",
  "bookId": "ACT",
  "reference": "Ogokora Kw’abatomwa 23",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "23",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "23",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo akarigereria mono abanto b’ekegambero, akabora: “Baminto, nabeireo ase obosio bwa Nyasae goika reero iga, na enkoro yane tekongambia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anania, Omokuani omonene, agachiika baria bateneine ang’e nere bamoake omonwa oye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Paulo akamoteebia: “Nyasae nagoake aye, enyasi eakire echooka! Aye gwaikaransire konachera inche ekiina boronge koreng’ana buna ogochika, naende kogoteeba mamincha y’amachiiko ng’a ng’akwe?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baria bateneine ang’e nere bakaboora: “Inee! Naye okorama Omokuani omonene o Nyasae?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo agateeba ng’a: “Tinamanyete baminto ng’a ere n’Omokuani omonene, naki nariikire: Tokwana bobe omogambi bw’abaanto bao.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ekero Paulo achia komanya ng’a ensemo eyemo n’Abasadukai, na ensemo ya kabere n’Abafarisai, agaaka eriogi ase ekegambero keria, agateeba: “Abaminto, inche n’Omofarisai, omwana bw’Abafarisai; inche nigo nkogambigwa ase engencho y’ogosemeria na ase okobokigwa kw’abakuure.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio gakwanire aya, ogwatananekana gokaba egati y’Abafarisai na Abasadukai, na omosangererekano ogaatananekana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki Abasadukai nigo bagokana ng’a kobokigwa tikori, nonya nabamalaika, nonya nemeika, korende Abafarisai nigo bagwancha onsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bikaba ebituri ebinge; aborokia b’amariiko b’ensemo y’Abafarisai bagatenena, bakamobuna, bagoteeba: “Titorochi bobe bonde ase omonto oyo. Aande onye n’Omoika gose omomalaika okwanire nere?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero eriomana rinene riachia kooroka, omotang’ani oria omonene akoboa ng’a Paulo nabaise kobutoranwa nabarabwo, agachiika abarwani baike na komotaboria korwa ase amaboko abo, na komorenta ase enyomba enene y’abarwani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obotuko bori’Omonene agatenena ang’e nere, akamoteebia: “Remia enkoro, ekiagera buna kwamberete kirori Yerusalemu, nekogwenerete kombera boigo Rumi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okobwatana kw’Abayahudi komoboera Paulo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bogachia gokiamoka, Abayahudi bakabwatana komoboera Paulo, bagatianania ng’a tibakoria gose tibakonywa goika bamoitire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abwo batiananetie nigo barenge abanto kobua emerongo ene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barabwo bakagenda ase abakuani abanene na abagaaka, bakaboora: “Ntwatiananetie bokong’u ng’a titoria gento goika twaitire Paulo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaki bono inwe amo nab’ekegambero moteebie omotang’ani oria omonene amotirimbokie gocha ase more, buna inwe morigetie komanya chingencho chiaye buya kobua; na intwe nigo tore ang’e komoita ritang’ani ataraika ase more.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omoigwa o Paulo akaigwa amang’ana igoro y’okoboera kwabo, akagenda, agasoa ime ase enyomba enene, akamanyia Paulo amang’ana ayio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo akarangeria oyomo bw’abatang’ani b’abarwani rigana, akamoteebia: “Ira omomura oyo ase omotang’ani omonene, ekiagera nabwate ring’ana akomoteebia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio akamoimokia, akamoira ase omotang’ani oria omonene, akamoteebia: “Paulo, oria omosibwa nandangeria, omboria nkorentere omomura oyo, ekiagera nare ne ring’ana akogoteebia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omotang’ani oria omonene akamobwata okoboko, akagenda nere ensemo, akamobooria bobisi: “Ing’ana ki obwate origetie gonteebia?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabora: “Abayahudi babwatanire kogosaba otirimbokie Paulo gochia bosio bw’ekegambero ankio, buna igo barigetie komanya chingencho chiaye buya kobua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaki aye tibwancha, ekiagera abanto kobua emerongo ene bamoboeire, batiananirie ng’a tibakoria gose tibakonywa goika bamoitire; na barabwo nigo bare ang’e baganyete eira korwa ase ore.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio omotang’ani oria omonene agatiga omomura oria agende, akamoteebia: “Toteebia monto onde ng’a kwamanyirie aya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo okoirwa goika Kaisaria",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’ayio akarangeria babere b’abatang’ani b’abarwani rigana, akabateebia: “Beka ang’e abarwani amagana abere, na abarwani abariini chibarasi emerongo etano na ebere, na abare namatimo amagana abere ase okogenda Kaisaria chinsa isato chia botuko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende beka ang’e chibarasi bariinie Paulo, momoire buya ase Feliki, gabana.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akarika riruube iga:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "pi"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ase omosike gabana Feliki. Inche Klaudio Lisia, nagokwanirie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto oyo nigo abwatwa n’Abayahudi, na barabwo bakaba ang’e komoita. Erio ngacha nomoganda bw’abarwani, nkamotooria, konya nanyorire amang’ana ng’a n’Omorumi are.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende nkarigia komanya engencho yaye bakomosoera, nkamotirimbokia na komobeka bosio bw’ekegambero kiabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkanyora ng’a nigo asoeirwe ase engencho y’amaborio ’amachiiko abo, korende tasoeiri ase ring’ana rigwenerete agoitwa nonya ngosibwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero nanyora amang’ana ng’a Abayahudi bamoboereire omonto oyo, ngachora komotoma ase ore erio kegima, ngachiika abamosoeri bache bakwane amang’ana igoro yaye ase obosio bwao.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abarwani baria bakaimokia Paulo buna bachiigetwe, bakamoira gochia Antipatiri ase obotuko boria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero bwakia mambia bagatiga abarwani be chibarasi bagenderere norogendo na Paulo, na barabwo abanyene bakairana ase enyomba enene y’abarwani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abarwani baria be chibarasi bagachia goika Kaisaria, bakaa gabana riruube riria, bakabeeka na Paulo ase obosio bwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero arisomire, akaboria: “Omonto oyo noyo bw’ense ki?” Ekero aigwete ng’a nomonto o Kilikia, agateeba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ninche nyigwe amang’ana ao ekero abagosoeri bao barache.” Agachiika arendwe ase enyomba y’ekegambero kia Herode.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
